V --> A["Central VPC<br/>AZ A target subnet"]:::process
V --> B["Central VPC<br/>AZ B target subnet"]:::process
A -->|Equivalent allowed routes| P["Existing direct peering<br/>Routes and security rules"]:::reference
B -->|Equivalent allowed routes| P
P --> X["Application VPCs<br/>Other accounts in the Region"]:::output
